.DS_Store
node_modules

# AI-assistant config (local only)
.claude/

# The signed Student Project Agreement must never reach this public repo: it is a
# legal form carrying signatures and personal details. See docs/README.md.
docs/**/*Agreement*.pdf

# Local scratch that lives beside the project but is not part of it. The same
# two lines exist in my-app/.gitignore; these cover the repo root, because a
# pattern in a subdirectory's file only ever matches inside that subdirectory.
#
# /demo/   the bookshop fixture and its runbook — seed data for a walkthrough,
#          rebuilt from scratch whenever it is needed, so it is not source.
# /*.pdf   generated handouts at the root, e.g. Schema-Studio-Field-Guide.pdf.
#          Documents that are meant to be kept go in docs/ and are tracked.
/demo/
/*.pdf
